        "exact_text": "Notwithstanding Section 6.5(a), Parent shall, or shall cause the Surviving Company or another its Subsidiaries to, (i) honor the terms of the annual cash bonus program for 2026 as in effect at the Closing Date (the “2026 Bonus Program”) and (ii) determine the amount payable under the 2026 Bonus Program in a manner consistent with the Company’s past practices, except that, in each case, any bonus payable under the 2026 Bonus Program shall be prorated based on a fraction, the numerator of which is the number of days between January 1, 2026 and the Closing Date (including the Closing Date) and the denominator of which is 365",
